        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Thuanc kho, damcloumei Kaipouc Poubauhmei ta!",
            "Theihmei t’rou khou ^&5 Thuakloumeipu ta;",
            "Hymdaihmei Kazanc bwanna lu ^&5 thuanc kho!",
            "Thuaklou, gulou, ngammeipu Kamei e.",
            "",
            "",
            "Pou .. ta .. thuanc .. kho!",
            "Kauh liangmei khou Kaipouc",
            "Hymdaihmei zanc thuanc diu!",
            "Pou .. ta .. thuanc .. kho!",
            "Kaipouc ’niw Guangc zanc hei guigay diu!",
            "2 Thuanc kho, aniu ta gaekloumei Kaipouc ta!",
            "Duplouna ’niw duakpui bamv Tauhdaic e;",
            "Kamei hei aniu ta Gaengcloumeipu e,",
            "Dui-chu luanghmei nzaengc khou zaylou e.",
            "",
            "3 Thuanc kho, gaymei patpui bamv Duipuakkai ta!",
            "’Taw tingkauh kai khou saengc daicna bam e;",
            "Kazauzian lev Kalatryan khou hei lwm o,",
            "Kazauzian ^&5 taek makn gaeklou ni."
          ]
        }
      },
